#: admin/views/pages/parts/slider-settings.php:1038
msgid "Disabled (Smart Pad)"
msgstr "無効 (Smart Pad)"

#: admin/views/pages/parts/slider-settings.php:1045
msgid ""
"Smart Crop ensures your responsive slides are cropped to a ratio that "
"results in a consistent slideshow size."
msgstr "スマートクロップは、レスポンシブスライドが一貫したスライドショーサイズになる比率でトリミングされることを保証します。"

#: admin/views/pages/parts/slider-settings.php:1053
msgid "Image Crop Source"
msgstr "画像トリミングソース"

#: admin/views/pages/parts/slider-settings.php:1058
